  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/default/0",
    "raw": "Instructions",
    "value": "介绍"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/default/1",
    "raw": "Select a research by clicking one of the icons on the grid.\nYou can navigate the grid by dragging with the left mouse button.\n\n- The left most button at the upper part of the screen opens a list of research trees to pick from.\n\n- The second button opens a list of non-hidden research options. Click a research on the displayed to center the view on it. Click again to hide the list.\n\n- The third button will center the view on the middle of the tree, or the currently selected research.\n\n- The last button toggles ^orange;low quality mode^reset;. This makes the GUI jump to a position instead of panning to it, or the center button. In addition, dragging/navigating on the the main screen will update only after you release the mouse button. It is best to use the search list with this mode enabled.",
    "value": "通过点击网格上的图标来选择一项研究。\n您可以通过按住鼠标左键拖动来导航网格。\n\n- 屏幕顶部最左侧的按钮用于打开可供选择的研究树列表。\n\n- 第二个按钮用于打开非隐藏的研究选项列表。点击列表中显示的研究项，可将视图居中定位到该研究的图标上。再次点击该按钮可隐藏列表。\n\n- 第三个按钮用于将视图居中定位到科技树的中心，或者当前选中的研究项目上。\n\n- 最后一个按钮用于切换 ^orange;低质量模式^reset;。此模式下，界面将直接跳转到目标位置，而非通过平移动画（搜索列表或居中按钮触发的动画）移动。此外，在主屏幕上的拖动导航操作，仅在释放鼠标按钮后才会更新视图。建议在此模式下使用搜索列表功能。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/survival_1/0",
    "raw": "Basic Training",
    "value": "基础训练"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/survival_1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYour training, thanks to four years in the Protectorate Academy, provides you with basic survival skills to keep you alive for extended periods in the event of a crash.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n得益于在守护团学院的四年学习，您所受的训练为你提供了基本的生存技能，确保在发生坠机等意外时能够长时间维持生命。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/engineering/0",
    "raw": "Machining",
    "value": "机械加工"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/engineering/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nThe ^orange;Machining Table^reset; is the place to produce mechanical components, and will serve as the base workstation for many of your scientific forays. You've learned to create one yourself along with variety of basic items used in engineering.\n\nTo craft a ^orange;Machining Table^reset; you'll need to use your basic ^green;[C]rafting^reset; menu.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n^orange;加工台^reset;是制造机械零件的场所，将作为您多数科学探索的基础工作站。您已学会如何制作加工台，以及工程中使用的各种基础物品。\n\n要制作^orange;加工台^reset;，您需要使用基础^green;[C]^reset;制作菜单。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/goldcircuitry/0",
    "raw": "Gold Circuits",
    "value": "金电路"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/goldcircuitry/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nGold has many useful applications in computing. You can now put it to use in the creation of useful processors and RAM sticks. Make sure to upgrade your Machining Table into an ^orange;Auto Assembler^reset; first!",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n金元素在计算机领域有许多实用应用。您现在可以将其用于制造实用的处理器和内存条。请确保先将加工台升级为^orange;自动组装器^reset;！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/shields/0",
    "raw": "Shields",
    "value": "“护盾”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/shields/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nWith a solid understanding of computer technology and physics you can now create Force Fields that ^green;protect your base from harm^reset;, ^green;control gravity^reset; and ^green;provide breathable air^reset;. Quite useful!\n\nTo protect a location, place two field markers at the opposite corners of a square around the area, and wire them to the field generator's output connector. Field extenders can be used as relays, to connect the field markers beyond the normal wiring range.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n随着对计算机技术和物理学的深入理解，您现在可以创建力场，^green;保护基地免受伤害^reset;、^green;控制重力^reset;并^green;提供可呼吸空气^reset;。非常实用！\n\n要保护某个区域，请在区域周围正方形的对角放置两个力场标记，并将它们连接到立场发生器的输出接口。力场扩展器可用作中继器，以连接超出正常布线范围的力场标记。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/graphenecircuitry/0",
    "raw": "Graphene Circuits",
    "value": "石墨烯电路"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/graphenecircuitry/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nThe wonderful material known as Graphene conducts electricity far better than its carbon origins might indicate. With it, you can create very durable, heat resistant circuits that will be useful in heavy machinery.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n石墨烯这种奇妙材料的导电性远优于其碳元素来源。利用它，您可以制造出非常耐用且耐热的电路，这些电路将在重型机械中发挥作用。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/modulecrafting/0",
    "raw": "Upgrade Crafting",
    "value": "升级工艺"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/modulecrafting/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nUsing your knowledge of microengineering, you can now fabricate your own upgrade modules, manipulator modules and tech cards at your Auto Assembler.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n运用您的微工程技术知识，您现在可以在自动装配机上制造升级模块、物质枪模块和科技卡。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/protocitecircuitry/0",
    "raw": "Protocite Circuits",
    "value": "原体电路"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/protocitecircuitry/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've put the insane energy-transferring properties of Protocite to work in highly complex processors which work with quantum bits - no longer just 1 or 0, but sometimes both! Quantum Procesors have many uses in higher-end electronics.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您已将原体物质疯狂的能量转移特性应用于高度复杂的处理器，这些处理器使用量子位工作 - 不再局限于1或0，有时可以同时处于两种状态！量子处理器在高端电子产品中有多种用途。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/focusingarray/0",
    "raw": "Focusing Arrays",
    "value": "聚焦阵列"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/focusingarray/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nBy combining quantum computing with specialized crystals, you can create energy-focusing devices that are excellent in high-tech machines as well as powerful energy weapons.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n通过将量子计算与特殊晶体相结合，您可以创造出能量聚焦装置，这些装置在高科技机器和强力能量武器中表现优异。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/microformer/0",
    "raw": "Terraforming",
    "value": "地质改造"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/microformer/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nThrough the combination of Ancient Essence and robust particle focusers, you can now alter a small part of a planet to better suit your desires using microformation devices.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n通过结合古代精华与强大的粒子聚焦器，您现在可以使用微型成形设备改变星球的局部区域，使其更符合你的需求。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/terraformer/0",
    "raw": "Terraforming II",
    "value": "地形改造 II"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/terraformer/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYou can now shape entire planets to your liking, altering their environment to new types. Note that this will not work for Ocean worlds, which is why no such terraformers exist.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n您现在可以根据自己的喜好改造整个行星，将其环境转变为新的类型。请注意，此功能不适用于海洋世界，这就是不存在此类地形改造器的原因。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/terraformer2/0",
    "raw": "Terraforming III",
    "value": "地形改造 III"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/terraformer2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nThanks to your understanding of terraforming devices you can now create even more interesting forms of worlds.",
    "value": "^orange;6级^reset;\n\n凭借你对地形改造装置的理解，您现在可以创造出更加有趣的行星形态。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/morphitecircuitry/0",
    "raw": "Morphite Circuits",
    "value": "异极电路"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/morphitecircuitry/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nWith access to Morphite, even AI technology is within your reach, allowing the creation of supremely fast computing components that are capable of self-improvement and basic decision-making. It's no surprise that many governments ban this technology outright for fear of what amazing things it can do.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n随着能够获取异极合金，人工智能技术也已触手可及，可以创造出能够自我改进和进行基本决策的超高速计算组件。毫不意外，许多政府完全禁止这项技术，唯恐其可能实现的惊人成果。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/powercores1/0",
    "raw": "Energy Cores",
    "value": "能量核心"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/powercores1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've designed a trio of powerful energy cores, each with their own laundry list of scientific and military applications. Molten Cores are excellent when dealing with intense heat such as in blast furnaces or lava-spewing flamethrowers. Power Cores shine in kinetic applications, and are useful in machines with many moving parts and high-end ballistic weaponry. Nuclear Cores are useful for channeling radiation, such as in a fission reactor, or just plain making tons of energy for high-demand inventions.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您已设计出三种强大的能量核心，每种都拥有各自的一系列科学和军事应用。熔火核心擅长处理高强度热量，适用于鼓风炉或熔岩喷射火焰喷射器。能量核心在动能应用方面表现出色，是含有多运动部件机械和高端弹道武器的实用组件。核能核心可用于引导辐射，如在裂变反应堆中，或单纯为高能耗发明提供大量能量。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/powercores2/0",
    "raw": "Improved Cores",
    "value": "改进核心"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/powercores2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYour skill with compact power sources has allowed you to make two more useful cores, expanding your engineering capability greatly. Teleporter Cores are perfect for transportation and constructing large, automated item networks, while Particle Cores are unmatched at channeling atomic and subatomic particles - the photons in a powerful laser, for example.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n您对紧凑型电源的掌握使您能够制造另外两种实用的核心，极大地扩展了工程能力。传送核心非常适合运输和构建大型自动化物品网络，而粒子核心在引导原子和亚原子粒子方面无与伦比 - 例如强大激光中的光子。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/teleporters/0",
    "raw": "DIY Teleportation",
    "value": "自定义传送器"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/teleporters/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nNo longer do you need to pay a professional - you ^green;are^reset; that professional! You can make a variety of personal teleporters on your own.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n您不再需要聘请专业人士 - 您自己就^green;是^reset;专业人士！您可以独立制造各种个人传送器。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers1/0",
    "raw": "Research Computers",
    "value": "研究用计算机"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've put your knowledge of computer parts to use to produce handy laptops that will automatically research items for you.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n您已将计算机部件的知识应用于制造便携式笔记本电脑，这些电脑会自动为您研究物品。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers2/0",
    "raw": "Improved Researchers",
    "value": "改进研究"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nAccess to quantum computing means you can make stronger computers that research more quickly and store more data.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n掌握量子计算意味着您能制造更强大的计算机，以更快的速度进行研究并存储更多数据。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers3/0",
    "raw": "Neural Networks",
    "value": "神经网络"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nWith AI technology, you've designed a data tower which will generate huge amounts of research for your benefit, vastly outstripping all computers that came before it.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n运用人工智能技术，您设计的数据塔将为您生成大量研究成果，其能力远超之前的所有计算机。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers4/0",
    "raw": "Superior Networks",
    "value": "高级网络"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/computers4/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYour AI is super-advanced now, and generate huge amounts of research for your benefit, allowing you to kick off your shoes and finally let something do the work for you that you can rely on.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n您的人工智能现已高度先进，能为您生成海量研究资料，让您得以轻松自在，终于可以依赖它来代劳那些繁琐的工作了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/extraction1/0",
    "raw": "Extraction Basics",
    "value": "萃取基础"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/extraction1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've learned the basics of resource extraction and can now build rudimentary devices to extract, research and centrifuge materials. \n\n^cyan;Extractor^reset;\n\nPut almost anything in and it will convert it into something else. Most items are processed in groups of 50. \n\n^cyan;Centrifuge^reset;\n\nPut any liquid inside and the centrifuge will start working - though the wooden one isn't quite durable enough to handle lava and other volatile stuff. Researched in the ^orange;Power Systems^reset; tree. \n\n^cyan;Research Computer^reset;\n\nPut an item with a value greater than 0 in one and it will automatically convert it into an amount of research equal to ^green;5% of the item's pixel value^reset;. Faster computers can be built by pursuing ^orange;Gold Circuits^reset; research.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n您已掌握资源萃取的基础知识，现在可以制造基础设备来提取、研究和离心材料。\n\n^cyan;萃取器^reset;\n\n投入几乎任何物品，它都能将其转化为其他形式。大多数物品以50个为一组进行处理。\n\n^cyan;离心机^reset;\n\n放入任何液体，离心机就会开始工作 - 不过木制离心机的耐用性不足，无法处理熔岩和其他挥发性物质。请在^orange;电力系统^reset;科技树中研究升级。\n\n^cyan;研究计算机^reset;\n\n将价值大于0像素的物品放入其中，它会自动将物品转换为相当于^green;该物品像素价值5%^reset;的研究点数。通过进行^orange;金电路^reset;研究可以建造更快的计算机。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/extraction2/0",
    "raw": "Extraction Labs",
    "value": "萃取实验"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/extraction2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nThe extraction lab is a big step up over the hand mill, working much more quickly. You'll want many extraction labs to process all sorts of resources.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n萃取实验室相比手工粉碎机是一大进步，工作速度更快。您需要多个萃取实验室来处理各类资源。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/extraction3/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Extraction",
    "value": "高级萃取"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/extraction3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've greatly improved upon your extraction lab design, producing a lab that is faster than ever at processing resources and even gives some bonus outputs.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您对萃取实验室的设计进行了重大改进，打造出的实验室处理资源速度空前，甚至能提供额外产出。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/robotics1/0",
    "raw": "Basic Robotics",
    "value": "基础机器人"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/robotics1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nWith your engineering knowledge, you have designed a few basic depolyable robot minions to help you out.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n凭借您的工程学知识，您已设计出一些基础的可部署机器人仆从来协助您。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/robotics2/0",
    "raw": "Stronger Robots",
    "value": "强力机器人"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/robotics2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYour robotic knowledge is growing, and it shows in your handy new designs. You now have access to stronger robots.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您的机器人知识不断增长，这体现在您便捷的新设计中。您现在可以使用更强大的机器人了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/robotics3/0",
    "raw": "Murderbots",
    "value": "杀戮机器人"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/robotics3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYou're a master at making combat drones. Your latest creations are deadlier than ever and will protect you quite nicely.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n您是制造战斗无人机的大师。您的最新作品比以往任何时候都更加致命，并能很好地保护您。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/tinkering1/0",
    "raw": "Tinkering",
    "value": "改造"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/tinkering1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou're learning that engineering isn't just about making new things, but improving on the ones you already made. To this end, you've learned to create a ^orange;Tinkering Table^reset; which will allow you to make EPP modules, mining gear, special weapon upgrades, and useful tools such as a Hookshot or Mining Laser.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n您正在认识到，工程学不仅仅是创造新事物，更是在已有创造的基础上进行改进。为此，您已学会创建^orange;改造台^reset;，它能让您制作EPP模块、采矿装备、特殊武器升级，以及钩爪或采矿激光等实用工具。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmbasic/0",
    "raw": "Basic EPP Modules",
    "value": "基础EPP模块"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmbasic/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've developed a suite of simple EPP modules which can be installed to gain useful benefits in addition to the effects your EPP already provides.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n您已开发了一套简单的EPP模块，这些模块可以安装以获取除EPP本身效果之外的有用增益。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmadv/0",
    "raw": "Improved Modules",
    "value": "改进模块"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmadv/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've improved upon your EPP module design, developing upgrades for many of your modules and inventing a few new ones, too.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您已改进了EPP模块的设计，为许多模块开发了升级版本，并发明了一些新的模块。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmres1/0",
    "raw": "Defensive Modules",
    "value": "防护模块"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmres1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've designed a lot of new EPP modules which will protect you from heat, radiation, cold and other hazards. Surviving hostile environments has never been so easy.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您已设计了许多新的EPP模块，能够保护您免受高温、辐射、寒冷及其他危害。在充满敌意的环境中生存从未如此轻松。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmres2/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Protection",
    "value": "高级防护"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmres2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYour defensive modules have gotten even better, allowing you to resist more exotic elements like Cosmic and Shadow and completely protect from hot, cold or radioactive planets.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n您的防御模块性能已进一步提升，能够抵抗更多特殊元素（如宇宙射线和暗影能量），并对高温、寒冷或放射性行星环境提供完全防护。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmbest/0",
    "raw": "Module Mastery",
    "value": "模块精通"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/eppmbest/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nWith mastery of EPP modules comes several new amazingly useful creations that will provide incredible benefits. In addition to improving your already considerably impressive designs, you can even ward off Erchius Ghosts, insanity, sheer darkness or the need to eat!",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n随着对EPP模块的精通掌握，您已创造出多项极具实用价值的新作品，它们将带来惊人的增益效果。除了改进您已经相当出色的设计外，您甚至能够抵御厄尔吉斯幽灵、精神错乱、纯粹黑暗，连进食需求也得以免除！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/musicplayers/0",
    "raw": "Music",
    "value": "音乐"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/musicplayers/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou can now create a variety of music boxes at your Tinkering Table. These can play any music from Starbound, Frackin' Universe or the add-on Frackin' Music, if you have it installed.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n您现在可以在改造台上制作多种音乐盒。这些音乐盒可以播放来自Starbound、富兰克林的宇宙或已安装的Frackin' Music扩展包中的任何音乐。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mining1/0",
    "raw": "Improved Mining",
    "value": "改进采矿"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mining1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've gained the ability to make a variety of more useful mining tools. Of particular note is the Mining Laser, which can be upgraded with Manipulator Modules and uses your energy instead of durability. With enough upgrades, they get quite fast, and are a worthy investment.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n您已获得制作多种更实用采矿工具的能力。尤其值得关注的是采矿激光器，它可使用物质枪模块进行升级，并消耗能量而非耐久度。通过足够升级后，其采矿速度将相当迅速，是一项值得的投资。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mining2/0",
    "raw": "Power Mining",
    "value": "强力采矿"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mining2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nThey may not last forever, but they sure do mine fast. You gain access to a few more consumable mining tools.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n这些工具或许不能永久使用，但开采速度确实很快。您可以制造几种消耗型采矿工具。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/gadgets1/0",
    "raw": "Gadgetry",
    "value": "妙具"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/gadgets1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've developed a number of useful tools. Their functionality can be improved by upgrading them with manipulator modules.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n您已开发出多种实用工具。它们的功能可通过使用物质枪模块进行升级来改进。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/gadgets2/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Gadgets",
    "value": "高级妙具"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/gadgets2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYour experimentation has led to the creation of a few cool new toys.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您的实验已创造出一些很酷的新装备。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/gadgets3/0",
    "raw": "Gadgeteering Mastery",
    "value": "妙具精通"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/gadgets3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYour desire for progress has led you to experiment with Morphite to plan a brand-new, super-awesome Matter Manipulator, as well as a few other creations on the side.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n您对进步的渴望促使您使用异级合金来规划一款全新的、超级出色的物质枪，以及一些其他的创造物。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/manipulator1/0",
    "raw": "Quantum Manipulation",
    "value": "量子操纵"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/manipulator1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nTurns out you could do better than just Morphite. With a Quantum Manipulator, you can rewrite the fabric of reality itself to excavate vast amounts of material in record time. The Protectorate would be quite jealous, if it still existed.",
    "value": "^orange;6级^reset;\n\n事实证明，您可以做得比异级合金更好。通过量子物质枪，您能够改写现实本身的结构，在创纪录的时间内挖掘大量物质。如果守护团还存在的话，他们一定会非常嫉妒。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/experimentweapons/0",
    "raw": "Experimental Weapons",
    "value": "实验性武器"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/experimentweapons/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nYou've just got so many ideas floating around in your head that there's nothing else to do but put them all onto paper. You can now upgrade several pre-existing weapons into bizarre and lethal new forms.",
    "value": "^orange;6级^reset;\n\n您脑海中涌现出太多创意，除了将它们全部付诸纸上之外别无他法。您现在可以将若干现有武器升级为怪异而致命的新形态。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/spacebasic/0",
    "raw": "Spacefaring and Vehicles",
    "value": "航天飞行和载具"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/spacebasic/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYour spaceship may have broken down, but that doesn't mean you can't fix it. Using parts from your old junked FTL drive and the thermal power of Core Fragments, you are now able to make a basic ship engine (^cyan;STL Engine^reset;, created at a ^orange;Machining Table^reset;).\n\nWhile fine for intrastellar travel, the STL engine isn't nearly powerful enough to leave your system - you'll need to ^orange;Research^reset; proper FTL technology to do that.\n\nIf ^cyan;Fuel^reset; is proving an issue to find for your ship: head to a ^green;Moon^reset; or produce some ^cyan;Hydrogen^reset; by processing water (via ^orange;Extraction^reset; or ^orange;Centrifuge^reset;).\n\nAdditionally, you can craft a very simple mech for EVA or planetary usage (created at a ^orange;Mech Part Crafting Table^reset;. You can ^green;Research^reset; one later, or use the one at the ^orange;Outpost^reset;).\n\nMechs will provide a large amount of damage resistance and help you stay alive for longer in harsh situations, and are able to ^green;Fly^reset; in an atmosphere as well as space.\n\nIf you're having trouble finding ^orange;Core Fragments^reset;, just dig towards the planet core. You'll find some there.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n您的宇宙飞船可能已经故障，但这并不意味着无法修复。利用旧废弃FTL引擎的部件和星核碎片的热能，您现在可以制造一个基本的飞船引擎（^cyan;STL引擎^reset;，在^orange;加工台^reset;制造）。\n\n虽然适合星系内旅行，但STL引擎的动力不足以离开您当前的星系 - 您需要^orange;研究^reset;适当的超光速技术来实现这一目标。\n\n如果为飞船寻找^cyan;燃料^reset;成为问题：请前往^green;卫星^reset;或通过处理水来生产一些^cyan;氢^reset;（通过^orange;萃取^reset;或^orange;离心^reset;）。\n\n此外，您可以制造一台用于舱外活动或行星使用的简易机甲（在^orange;机甲部件加工台^reset;制造。您可以在后续^green;研究^reset;，或使用^orange;前哨站^reset;的那台）。\n\n机甲将提供巨额伤害抗性，帮助您在恶劣环境中存活更久，并且能够在大气层和太空中^green;飞行^reset;。\n\n如果您难以找到^orange;星核碎片^reset;，只需向行星核心挖掘。您会在那里找到一些。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/spaceftl1/0",
    "raw": "Faster than Light",
    "value": "与光同尘"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/spaceftl1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nThe science behind Erchius Crystals is still very vague, but one thing is known for certain: these crystals hold the key to FTL travel. With the ability to make your own FTL drives, the whole galaxy is now open to exploration.\n\nWhen Erchius-based drives were still in their infancy, only Erchius fuel could power FTL travel. However, it has since been discovered how to fuel drives with a variety of sources such as ^green;radioactive isotopes^reset; or ^green;biofuel^reset;.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n厄尔吉斯水晶背后的科学原理仍然模糊不清，但有一点是确定的：这些水晶掌握着超光速旅行的关键。拥有了制造自己FTL驱动器的能力，整个星系现在都可以进行探索了。\n\n当基于厄尔吉斯水晶的引擎还处于初级阶段时，只有厄尔吉斯燃料能为FTL旅行提供动力。然而，后来人们发现了如何使用多种物质来驱动引擎，例如^green;放射性同位素^reset;或^green;生物燃料^reset;。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/shipcrafting/0",
    "raw": "Shipcrafting",
    "value": "造船工艺"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/shipcrafting/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've designed a Ship Crafting Table to produce more advanced ship components.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n您已设计出一个飞船设备制造台，用于生产更先进的飞船组件。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/shipdecorative/0",
    "raw": "Ship Decoration",
    "value": "飞船装饰"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/shipdecorative/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou gain access to a large number of decorative ship objects. They don't do anything, but maybe they'll make your ship look cooler?",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n您现在可以使用大量装饰性飞船物品。它们没有任何实际功能，但或许能让您的飞船看起来更酷？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbasic/0",
    "raw": "Mech Creation",
    "value": "机甲制造"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbasic/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've learned a lot about building modular mechs and can now make galactic-standard mech parts at a ^orange;Mech Crafting Table^reset;.\n\nThe weight of your mech is very important. Lighter mechs get around more easily and burn less fuel, while heavy mechs are more durable and can crush things by jumping on them.\n\n^yellow;Note:^reset; You no longer need to gather \"salvage\" components to make mechs - they are now made with other resources such as circuit boards and energy cores. Salvage can be ^orange;extracted^reset; to provide potentially useful resources instead.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n您已经学到了很多关于建造模块化机甲的知识，现在可以在^orange;机甲部件制造台^reset;处制造星际标准的机甲部件了。\n\n机甲的重量非常重要。轻型机甲移动更灵活，燃料消耗也更少；而重型机甲则更耐用，并且可以通过跳跃践踏来压碎东西。\n\n^yellow;注意：^reset; 您不再需要收集“回收”组件来制造机甲 - 现在可以使用其他资源来制造，例如电路板和能量核心。那些废料可以被^orange;萃取^reset;以提供潜在的有用资源。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbody1/0",
    "raw": "Improved Mech Bodies",
    "value": "改进机甲躯体"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbody1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nWith increased crafting skill comes the ability to make more advanced mech bodies that resist damage and store more fuel and survive in dangerous atmospheres more easily.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n随着制造技能的提高，您将能够制造更先进的机甲躯体。这些躯体能抵御伤害、储存更多燃料，并且在危险环境中也更容易生存。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbody2/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Mech Bodies",
    "value": "高级机甲躯体"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbody2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYou can now make even stronger mech bodies using more complex materials.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n现在，您可以利用更复杂的材料制造出更坚固的机甲躯体。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbody3/0",
    "raw": "Superior Mech Bodies",
    "value": "卓越机甲躯体"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbody3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nThe strongest mech bodies around are now within your ability thanks to your mech-building talent.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n凭借您的机甲制造天赋，如今最强大的机甲躯体已触手可及。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmobility1/0",
    "raw": "Improved Mech Mobility",
    "value": "改进机甲机动"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmobility1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've improved on the movement systems of your mech and can now craft faster legs and boosters.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您对机甲的移动系统进行了升级，现在可以制造更快的腿部组件和推进器。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmobility2/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Mech Mobility",
    "value": "高级机甲机动"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmobility2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nIt's not enough to just go fast - you've got to go really, really fast. You're one step closer to that goal with your newly improved designs.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n仅仅快还不够 - 您要快到极致才满意。凭借您最新改进的设计，您离这个目标又近了一步。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmobility3/0",
    "raw": "Superior Mech Mobility",
    "value": "卓越机甲机动"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmobility3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYour talent has produced some of the highest-end mech parts around, letting you run, jump and fly your mech through the stars at record pace.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n您以才华打造出了顶尖的机甲部件，让您能以创纪录的速度，驾驶机甲在星际间奔跑、跳跃、翱翔。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsweapons1/0",
    "raw": "Improved Mech Weapons",
    "value": "改进机甲武器"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsweapons1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've learned to make some stronger weaponry for your mechs.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您已学会为你的机甲打造更强大的武器。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsweapons2/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Mech Weapons",
    "value": "高级机甲武器"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsweapons2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nThe universe can be a dangerous place, but not if you've got a really big gun. You can make even better mech weapons.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n宇宙可能是个危险之地，但如果您手握一把巨型枪械，情况就不同了。您甚至能打造出更强大的机甲武器。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsweapons3/0",
    "raw": "Superior Mech Weapons",
    "value": "卓越机甲武器"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsweapons3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nThe way you see it, there's no reason to own a mech if you can't strap a BFG to it and go to town on someone (or something) that deserves it. Your newest death-dealing mech weapons are perfect for doing just that.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n在您看来，如果不能给机甲装上巨型武器去狠狠教训那些该受惩罚的家伙（或事物），那拥有机甲就毫无意义。您最新研发的致命机甲武器，正是为此量身打造。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmodules1/0",
    "raw": "Improved Mech Modules",
    "value": "改进机甲模块"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmodules1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou can now craft better modules for your mech which grant better stats or increased utility.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n现在，您可以为你的机甲打造更优质的模块，以提升其性能或增强实用性。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmodules2/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Mech Modules",
    "value": "高级机甲模块"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmodules2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYou are able to craft even better mech modules.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n您能够打造出更出色的机甲模块。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmodules3/0",
    "raw": "Superior Mech Modules",
    "value": "卓越机甲模块"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsmodules3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYou can make incredibly powerful mech modules.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n您可以制造出极其强大的机甲模块。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbest/0",
    "raw": "Peerless Mech Crafting",
    "value": "绝世机甲制造"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/mechsbest/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nYou know everything there is to know about modular mechs. You can make extremely amazing mech parts that blow the competition away, and summon your mech to you in the field.",
    "value": "^orange;6级^reset;\n\n您对模块化机甲了如指掌，能够打造出惊艳绝伦、令对手望尘莫及的机甲部件，还能在战场上随时召唤您的专属机甲。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/spaceftl2/0",
    "raw": "Improved FTL Tech",
    "value": "改进超光速技术"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/spaceftl2/1",
